<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;I have found a way to do this but it is messy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;code&gt;perl -MPOSIX -MTime::Local -se 'print scalar timelocal($a, $b, $c, $d, $e, $f)' -- -a=$sec -b=$min -c=$hour -d=$day -e=$month -f=$year&lt;/code&gt;
